entries[347480] = { ["name"] = "Faeline Stomp", ["text"] = "Covenant Ability\n100 yd range\nInstant\nBrewmaster\nStrike the ground fiercely to expose a faeline for 30 sec, dealing (40% of Attack Power) Nature damage to up to 5 enemies, and restores (91% of Spell Power) health to up to 5 allies within 30 yds caught in the faeline. Stagger is 5% more effective for 8 sec against enemies caught in the faeline.\n\nYour abilities have a 6% chance of resetting the cooldown of Faeline Stomp while fighting on a faeline.\n\nMistweaver\nStrike the ground fiercely to expose a faeline for 30 sec, dealing (40% of Attack Power) Nature damage to up to 5 enemies, and restores (91% of Spell Power) health to up to 5 allies within 30 yds caught in the faeline. Up to 5 allies caught in the faeline are healed with an Essence Font bolt.\n\nYour abilities have a 6% chance of resetting the cooldown of Faeline Stomp while fighting on a faeline.\n\nWindwalker\nStrike the ground fiercely to expose a faeline for 30 sec, dealing (40% of Attack Power) Nature damage to up to 5 enemies, and restores (91% of Spell Power) health to up to 5 allies within 30 yds caught in the faeline. Up to 5 enemies caught in the faeline suffer an additional (65% of Attack Power) damage.\n\nYour abilities have a 6% chance of resetting the cooldown of Faeline Stomp while fighting on a faeline." }
